Enhanced sounds - sources and licence
=====================================

Every file in this folder was synthesized from scratch for this project by a
script (oscillators - square, pulse, triangle and sine waves - plus seeded
white noise, with filters, envelopes and echo), written in the style of a
16-bit console sound chip. No recordings, samples, sound libraries or
original game audio were used.

Author: the ultima1-engine contributors, 2026.
Licence: CC-BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/),
like the rest of the enhanced pack. Format: 22050 Hz mono 16-bit PCM WAV.

