Overworld footsteps (an engine option, F1 "Footsteps" / footsteps = on;
silent in the original, played only in the enhanced sound mode):
foot_grass.wav        0.09s  each move on foot over grass and open ground
foot_forest.wav       0.11s  each move on foot through forest
hooves.wav            0.16s  each move on a horse or in a cart
waves.wav             0.32s  each move on a raft or frigate
engine.wav            0.16s  each move in an aircar (or other engine)

Levels: every sound is set to 0.8 of the beeps' loudness (the RMS of the
loudest 50 ms; peaks at most twice the beep amplitude), footsteps and the
star field well below, and the five sounds for events the original leaves
silent at 0.3; the overworld footsteps at about 0.12-0.15.

Any event without a file here plays the original effect instead.
Music is not in these WAV files. Optional original compositions are
rendered by the engine at run time; see the root CREDITS file.
